Native dependencies are not stored in this repository. scripts/build-git-deps.sh
builds them from hash-pinned upstream sources into
packages/GitKit/Vendor/Clibgit2.xcframework, which is statically linked into the app:

  libgit2 1.9.7    GPL-2.0 with the libgit2 linking exception
                   https://github.com/libgit2/libgit2
  libssh2 1.11.1   BSD-3-Clause      https://libssh2.org
  OpenSSL 3.6.5    Apache-2.0 (libcrypto only)   https://www.openssl.org

libgit2 is linked unmodified, as its linking exception allows. Fixes to it go upstream.

The app also bundles, built from source:

  tree-sitter grammars (JavaScript, TypeScript/TSX, JSON, Python, Swift, CSS, HTML)
                   MIT, vendored by scripts/vendor-grammars.py from hash-pinned releases;
                   each grammar's LICENSE is kept next to its sources
  tree-sitter 0.26.13   MIT   https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter
  omnie-dev-editor-engine   MIT, a fork of Runestone by Simon B. Støvring
                   https://github.com/simonbs/Runestone

When iSH-based components (LinuxKit, vendor/ish) are added, the distributed app becomes a
GPLv3 combined work; COPYING.app will then describe that combination (PLAN §27).

